g for months on the plans for an elaborate new cathedral which he hopes will be paid for primarily by a wealthy, stubborn widow. He is losing sight of his family and of why he became a churchman in the first place. Enter Dudley, an angel sent to help him. Dudley does help everyone he meets, but not necessarily in the way they would have preferred. With the exception of Henry, everyone loves him, but Henry begins to believe that Dudley is there to replace him, both at work and in his family's affections, as Christmas approaches.","descriptionEn":null,"isOwnContent":false,"duration":null,"creatorCinemaId":null,"posterImageRef":null,"posterImageUrl":null,"backdropImageRef":null,"backdropImageUrl":null,"ageRating":null,"trailerUrl":null,"isRegularEvent":false,"hasMarketingAssistantBooked":false,"futureShowingsCount":1,"premiereDate":null,"cineamoMovie":null,"movieId":9419,"metrics":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.cineamo.com/contents/711506"}}},"cinema":{"id":1243,"name":"Astor Film Lounge HafenCity","shortName":"Astor Hamburg","slug":"astor-film-lounge-hafencity","description":"Freuen Sie sich auf Kino-Komfort, den Sie so bisher noch nicht erlebt haben: Vom Begrüßungscocktail über die Garderobe bis hin zum verstellbaren Liegesessel in den Kinosälen, Bedienung am Platz und 240 Parkplätzen direkt im Haus. Denn wir möchten, dass Ihr Kino Besuch zu einem Kino Erlebnis wird.","phone":"+491805777966","street":"Am Sandtorkai 46a","postalCode":"20457","city":"Hamburg","state":"Hamburg","stateAbbr":"HH","country":"Deutschland","countryCode":"DE","currencyCode":"EUR","longitude":9.99551964,"latitude":53.54349899,"distance":null,"profileImageRef":"8a6d2028-3926-4cdf-ba36-07bfeb45a259","profileImageUrl":"https://cdn.cineamo.com/cinema-profile-image/8a6d2028-3926-4cdf-ba36-07bfeb45a259","logoImageRef":"9e856679-7dc5-40aa-880a-8a95a1883f80","logoImageUrl":"https://cdn.cineamo.com/cinema-logo-image/9e856679-7dc5-40aa-880a-8a95a1883f80","logoWideImageRef":null,"logoWideImag